on mainkey
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 83 ........................... <the keyCode>
  [  5] pushint16 49 ............................ <49>
  [  8] eq ...................................... <the keyCode = 49>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 22] ............................ if the keyCode = 49 then
  [ 12] pushsymb 66 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 15] pushint16 1 ............................. <1>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1>
  [ 20] extcall 12 .............................. sound stop 1
  [ 22] ret
end
